    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Number of PSO offices outside of Honiara with established provincial paralegal support and appointment of paralegal officers.</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2018">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zero paralegal support to Public Solicitor&apos;s Office.</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">The capacity, reach and breadth of service delivery and awareness activities of Public Solicitors Office is increased through the development and roll out of Provincial Paralegals
- 3 provincial offices supported with provincial paralegal services
- 6 provincial paralegals appointed and trained and appointed by gender
- 25 communities sensitized as a result of outreach activities 

Community level access to justice is enhanced through the pilot, roll out and review of Community Legal Advocates
- 6 Community Legal Advocates identified in 4 selected priority communities
- 50 awareness activities undertaken by Community Legal Advocates in the 4 selected priority communities
- 50 communities visited by the CLAs to undertake awareness activities
- 20 referrals from CLAs to the PSO</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
